{"id": "h011", "text": "def moving_average(values, window):\n    total = 0.0\n    out = []\n    for i, v in enumerate(values):\n        total += v\n        if i >= window:\n            total -= values[i - window]\n        out.append(total / min(i + 1, window))\n    return out"}
